  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesuus Namicha Jaamaa Tokko Fayyisuu Isaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuus utuu darbuu namicha dhalootuma isaatii jalqabee jaamaa ture tokko arge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barattoonni isaas, \"Yaa barsiisaa, akka namichi kun jaamaa taʼee dhalatuuf eenyutu cubbuu hojjete? Isuma moo abbaa fi haadha isaa ti?\" jedhanii isa gaafatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuusis akkana jedhee deebise;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Akka hojiin Waaqaa isaan mulʼatuuf malee inni yookaan abbaa fi haati isaa cubbuu hojjetanii miti.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Utuu guyyaa taʼee jiruu hojii isa na ergee hojjechuun qabna. Halkan namni tokko iyyuu itti hojjechuu hin dandeenye ni dhufa.",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Ani yommuun addunyaa irra jiru, ifa addunyaa ti.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis erga waan kana dubbatee booddee lafatti tufee dhoqqee tolche; dhoqqee sanas ija namichaatti dibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis namicha sanaan,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Dhaqiitii Haroo Saliihoomitti dhiqadhu\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhe. Saliihoom jechuun kan ergame jechuu dha. Namichis dhaqee dhiqate; argaas deebiʼee dhufe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olloonni isaatii fi namoonni duraan utuu inni kadhatuu argan, \"Namichi kun isuma taaʼee kadhachaa ture sana mitii?\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namoonni tokko tokko, \"Eeyyee, isa\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 9:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaan immoo, \"Miti, isa fakkaata malee\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 9:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inni garuu, \"Namichi sun anuma\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jarris, \"Iji kee akkamitti baname ree?\" jedhaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis deebisee, \"Namicha Yesuus jedhamutu dhoqqee tolchee ija koo dibee, 'Gara Haroo Saliihoom dhaqiitii dhiqadhu' naan jedhe; anis dhaqeen dhiqadhe; arguus nan dandaʼe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis, \"Namichi sun eessa jira?\" jedhanii isa gaafatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 9:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Inni immoo, \"Ani hin beeku\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fariisonni Waaʼee Fayyuu Namichaa Qorachuu Isaanii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis namicha jaamaa ture sana Fariisotatti geessan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaan itti Yesuus dhoqqee tolchee ija namichaa bane Sanbata ture.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fariisonnis namichi akkamitti akka arguu dandaʼe isa gaafatan; namichis, \"Inni dhoqqee tolchee ija koo dibe; anis nan dhiqadhe; nan arges\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fariisota keessaas tokko tokko, \"Namichi kun waan Sanbata hin eegneef, inni Waaqa biraa hin dhufne\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 9:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Warri kaan garuu, \"Cubbamaan tokko akkamitti dinqii akkanaa hojjechuu dandaʼa?\" jedhan. Garaa garummaanis isaan gidduutti uumame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis amma illee namicha jaamaa ture sanaan, \"Waaʼee namicha ija kee siif bane sanaa maal jetta?\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "JHN 9:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Namichis deebisee, \"Inni raajii dha\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yihuudoonnis hamma abbaa fi haadha namicha agartuu isaa argate sanaa waamanitti akka inni jaamaa turee fi akka inni agartuu isaa argate amma illee hin amanne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis, \"Inni kun ilma keessan isuma isin jaamaa taʼee dhalate jettan sanaa? Yoos amma immoo akkamitti arguu dandaʼa ree?\" jedhanii gaafatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbaa fi haati namichaas deebisanii akkana jedhan; \"Akka inni ilma keenya taʼee fi akka inni jaamaa taʼee dhalate ni beekna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Garuu amma akkamitti akka arguu dandaʼe yookaan ija isaa eenyu akka baneef nu hin beeknu. Inni nama gaʼaa dha; waaʼee mataa isaa dubbachuu ni dandaʼa; isuma gaafadhaa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abbaa fi haati isaa sababii Yihuudoota sodaataniif waan kana jedhan; namni kam iyyuu yoo Yesuus inni Kiristoos",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhee dhugaa baʼe akka mana sagadaa keessaa ariʼamu Yihuudoonni kanaan dura walii galanii murteessanii turaniitii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanaafuu abbaa fi haati isaa, \"Inni nama gaʼaa dha; isuma gaafadhaa\" jedhan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis yeroo lammaffaa namicha jaamaa ture sana waamanii, \"Waaqaaf ulfina kenni. Namichi kun cubbamaa taʼuu isaa nu ni beekna\" jedhaniin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Innis, \"Cubbamaa taʼuu fi taʼuu baachuu isaa ani hin beeku. Ani waan tokkon beeka. Ani jaamaan ture; amma garuu nan arga!\" jedhee deebise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis, \"Inni maal siif godhe? Ija kees akkamitti siif bane?\" jedhanii isa gaafatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni immoo, \"Ani kanaan dura isinitti himeera; isinis hin dhageenye. Ammas maaliif dhagaʼuu barbaaddu? Isinis barattoota isaa taʼuu barbaadduu?\" jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis akkana jedhanii isa arrabsan; \"Barataan namicha kanaa siʼi! Nu barattoota Musee ti!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akka Waaqni Museetti dubbate nu beekna; namichi kun garuu eessaa akka dhufe iyyuu hin beeknu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis deebisee akkana jedhe; \"Inni eessaa akka dhufe wallaaluun keessan waan nama dinquu dha; garuu inni ija koo naa bane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akka Waaqni cubbamoota hin dhageenye ni beekna. Inni nama isa waaqeffatuu fi fedhii isaa guutu dhagaʼa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eenyu iyyuu ija nama jaamaa taʼee dhalate tokkoo akka bane uumama addunyaatii jalqabee hin dhagaʼamne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi kun utuu Waaqa biraa taʼuu baatee silaa homaa gochuu hin dandaʼu ture.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaanis deebisanii, \"Ati kan guutummaatti cubbuun dhalatte, situ nu barsiisaa?\" jedhaniin. Alattis gad isa baasan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jaamummaa Hafuuraa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuusis akka isaan gad isa baasan dhagaʼe; yommuu isa argettis,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Ati Ilma Namaatti ni amantaa?\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.35",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.35"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichis, \"Yaa gooftaa, akka ani isatti amanuuf inni eenyu?\" jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuusis,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Ati amma isa argiteerta; inni si wajjin haasaʼaa jiru isuma\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.37",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.37"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi sunis, \"Yaa Gooftaa, ani nan amana\" jedhe; ni sagadeefis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuus immoo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Warri hin argine akka arganiif, warri argan immoo akka jaamaniif ani murtiif gara addunyaa kanaa dhufeera\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.39",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.39"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fariisota isa wajjin turan keessaa tokko tokko waan kana jechuu isaa dhagaʼanii, \"Nus jaamota mitii ree?\" jedhanii gaafatan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesuusis,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"Utuu jaamota taatanii silaa cubbuu hin qabdan ture; isin garuu, 'Ni argina' jettu; cubbuun keessan ni jiraata\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JHN.9.41",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JHN.9.41"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jedheen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
